{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1363,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8bfd4f7e6e649330ddeaff3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！\r\n还有能够招福的「喵桑」陪我呢！\r\n我会带着信心去跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b587658043304de7382214d0b1ea6a5c21567bc6e80c1acef8aab36774000235",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc909ba676a259939abddf40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，Shiraoki大人的神谕……！\r\n嗯嗯，今天──\r\n我会吃到混在玉子烧里的蛋壳！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f25c597425e68d2a9942eea847a8e2dacc515908ceda4a6c7397b4f0e2b0a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a80dbf09a231fdfb730f217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员你听我说……！\r\n刚刚立了三根茶柱，然后……\r\n三根都……全沉下去了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b5983ae815e42c6f2275d232942c3a4343f375ccea824e1aae8c4e5baff8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0823c11f0e43965ec7a5f77e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵──作业写的很顺利呢～♪\r\n这都是因为我有开运转转铅笔\r\n这个好搭档的关系！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6527519fdd770109e4f1ce1ab42599a8884019587b7281083346dfaf175f8316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0c1eaa77d673b2702be352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到在春天苏醒的幸运象征……\r\n对了，瓢虫！来吧来吧，\r\n一起去找吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce2ac26c9598780c6358e7020a1704a74d8ac8557a1acf250c80ef8c33de94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b651d37378128655ad3b6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是樱桃很好吃的季节呢。\r\n不只好吃，还可以用樱桃籽占卜，\r\n……可以说是充满幸福的食物啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08241a0877d0da3ef3f6f25494bf1ce844f27a046fcd1f6997ed9b907d544a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1cd6b04be40730ab7c4ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很推荐秋天时做四国巡礼哦～！\r\n还可以享受到红叶及美食，\r\n可说是一石三鸟啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf965fe7b5623cfacf3ad179badd40dcbaeeeb9611dbb1d0feb24515976e32b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d87e2ee5c16f63ff410e69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是皮肤很容易干燥的那种，\r\n干脆涂上金粉，不只看起来喜庆，\r\n说不定还能改善干燥问题……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccc70c963e1b026b1bf630665ce158e462e6dbc9d2d5ba6bebbc9bd7acaf37a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f1e7b7feb4567a6d799052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个装御朱印用的小包包\r\n是我自己做的哦～！\r\n上面的鸟画得很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1ab2fb92e802fcef7281b623a42f1d13e45b1adedf7f2541f73bd415618d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41421466aeba6769497c72af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最适合训练员的护身符……\r\n嗯～特地要想就很难想到呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bee5706d8072f60367409d72d79a8e86c7e73eb2dc39990e3750b22ec5e822b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a2530dba2c124c5809419c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛因为打结的线手忙脚乱的……\r\n所以，我就给了她一个\r\n可以立刻解开结的护身符哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b74e903062683e24034e6e2c958f35a2d019c3b66685bfe8c71a100e04ad6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf26697369e5840017d25fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天空真的很受猫咪喜欢耶……\r\n她本身也很像猫的感觉……\r\n该不会她其实是招财猫的化身！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd1bca2836cf130b0fe05caf7480b7dada2554acfe28a71128064d7a271a815",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7b02e5363e4cfee331eafd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树约我一起出门。\r\n一起去能量景点加野餐好像不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a4d8bda5239116508485a99ab941a62e3bf922715a41d79b182c2515931779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d6922e124ea703bc263f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找早上的幸运蜘蛛的时候，\r\n不小心就把蜘蛛网给弄坏了……\r\n请原谅我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd69a27a461720fe2288c16a818eb8d7930e64d3c744bfa84dc1031ec82f576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77a4e65fd786388e8fc3276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次都会用午餐甜点的糖浆，\r\n在甜点上淋出大吉的字哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36f0feb120035d74dff08e7ed35c88fd0792f7db20974c30b8f032beb526736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8017b2ed09b53dc7381fdd75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论当下心情有多好，\r\n都不可以在晚上的时候吹口哨哦。\r\n不能像这样「咻──」地……啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92985541f292a3572991a75aee30aedeffed6d3812ac66be4c64ec5e0b0b3116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514b0cf86868605e35db6cf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏花的话，去神社好像不错呢！\r\n我会带春季幸运便当去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "362498f0eda10b64064571a096c88b231be6948e719a48374d5e4d2b40f00e24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1569adab21e1cebd613902aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到烟火在空中绽放，不好的运气\r\n也会烟消云散！所以，可以的话……\r\n我想和你一起去夏日祭典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f7dca56f0ab945ace39dd1fa67280029003fd258fcea55f038b7a0d76d4fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a9ce71f7a718fa9045462b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天是阴阳转换的时期！\r\n应该也要来更换一下\r\n护身符的组合呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ffedbef5747730dbb413c7213bc609175a519e9862305d5e6af796c1f21a56f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf273e60bcefc7304a10836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……训练员的围巾\r\n看起来好保暖……感觉一直有\r\n温暖的能量传来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab43cf2d4ee6ae3c75385adce4881736ec803ce27b368b23c93f3374c1c3b50c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cb60703180c5935d58de72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，有了这套衣服，\r\n我就不需要再找四叶幸运草了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab50d137fe23b2d24aaec2ea4f54933c4e7675cdcc8ddf93ff4c25416f12059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f709801da5db60bb41651943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是最强的开运服！\r\n训练员也想要的话，\r\n我可以帮你做开运搭配哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f20b36333f6421ca830ea08c4157b7ed6cd24f7f589178e871742afb3f6578",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f949ee7957789871c1b8596b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作跟占卜都已经做好了哦。\r\n那我们今天也开始进行训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "300dc7ba95ed8fe9f8f900473936fa9b60150f655a680fb09ec00b0af02a2f45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c3da05b1358f8799a426f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5e6d959ef5a2ccf43b16b72ce85e81a5fd39253a4426d3654a7e5ee57b5150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2883834affc3507e50d046a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来占卜看看在哪里\r\n训练会比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68e78332aee7d53ffc4e82caa2031a9653747d29fd7093ac2196c2edcde92a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b68a689770ae5657cc0f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……！身体充满了神灵力量啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "297d683343eb0d5e4bc0b126370c5bf2cd7d5445c420f7d8ed58156b26cdad95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154c2f9800b7970fab887038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了抓住福气，\r\n今天也要跟平常一样做开运冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9aad85e7ea1e842c80ab0f910a3af75b2ee8202eaab78bc85fd618b419c82d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860dccfe93010b4c42e4a25d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就照Shiraoki大人的神谕，\r\n去尽情地奔跑吧！\r\n这样一定能开启通往未来的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a1a803f6a7c95298ede815a438da5953ea094e86689e048d32583f98955e31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f26c07807bb3815f72e4fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你一直支持\r\n老是依赖占卜的我……！\r\n我会努力达到你的期望的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e7b679266dcbdde9f5f8ab5688d422951cfff877a6f5d3aad25cc1cad1212d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5483f0b4098ac13cd49073d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我完全信任占卜结果跟训练员！\r\n因为你是我命中注定的人啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51ea0c4d1fef29a6c04b721d47483c8141231de6a594b224c34bcd600b43c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:669706bf1498db394e68389f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦的训练项目也尽管来吧。\r\n我准备了无论怎么跑\r\n都不会肌肉酸痛的护身符！",
      "source_fingerprint": "357367ee4901b06ce67e74fb5f403887c0faadb6a184ee8dc9b82419462328c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd42d572b4c445b5eb9921f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相信运气会带来成果！\r\n今天也要好好地努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcbd638daa9f00e267d71008cdca6754cb24434030bea122a85e38cc0168076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e087f841d9d4bbea3d1e1053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要从全身的开运道具补充能量！\r\n耶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "517b2875a98d401cd15a8f682f03ce64c12f9ab34ad20f3ea544b493c6c2f7de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f455396d0bb79196517a769e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有预感你差不多就要来找我了！\r\n这都是开运装备的功劳呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8fb9bde120f209dead183f9ce28925ec4f644365bd53fc68f6ed7fd6a1dddb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ab42192b084462b8b0f088",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在葫芦里面装了运动饮料！\r\n已经彻底准备完成了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "737ff4f4576241d4f8e06b201f8084f5832648deea417c41447d5001ce03587e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90f1244371a5c777c9acb410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "众多开运道具的能量，\r\n再加上训练员的加持……\r\n简直就是如虎添翼了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22bb134929344fb309ce08c5f3b093c98a3af1edf84a26e4b68d5f129111547a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef2bd70db1b2bb3df5631ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要把一直以来累积的幸运能量，\r\n全部都用在大舞台上！\r\n开花爷爷训练员请引领我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3d585c76895bc87a81716a3748ac9b7e7e193f07aab10850ffbca1b3d50df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b3f44587d6aaa7ea2c7ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员累积很多回忆的话……！\r\n那些回忆，一定会成为神奇的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "228878437b264e64e06023d199a04c1b5ca0ee92dd7d36e2d40522ff13b7a736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3585d659221eb3e63cc8c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然训练员就是我命中注定的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "848fbea32f125d8a6b8d945c2262ff631005b19fa0d981fa698adad16b539e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af43f209f046eaf9681c7904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后我们也要一起抓住福气哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9a66ee07aa46d775e0765e3d3916e2fec5c0b4f0c6be8699e6d28883c119e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f61136a29eec2edf5a700c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从很久以前就怀抱的梦想……\r\n是你让它开花结果的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6c4ae42c5e3ddef80f17b929cd6c4d8355713958ecd065ebb3a3df9593c20e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614f8bef8ea0cf5047a78726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起走过了\r\n充满幸运及快乐的旅程呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce4c976cddc13995a8bc2ce11f1f05d5d4ca20a7af47c24cac9d380010fedbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a31c4203111702cfbd1e709",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！有股神奇的力量在涌现……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6b87b51ae35a5417d9d774254ffc9843a259d927e2905e18f921dded260ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216788ca00b8c18f24c9faf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开运大吉！神灵力量大爆发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e592f6e58cfaad1845868a3e893699aab8afc0b119d4908d0f8caf54b084cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de31fb1d636f2d37ef9d13a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我叫待兼福来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca42f0bb59ba723f8cfde3d2654053d62fabac23b881b37ac015be6168acdf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7762960b01d0721ac5d8c74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用新的占卜来成为助力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721014fd941d12054acc7e9df2bfbb5fdb74dfbf6157ad3537c8d974f5898cd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9395df3c544adcb6aaf8250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就当作是搭到了宝船，\r\n全都交给我吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a7ed1310a563f006d88d637b2307501458ff085f020aaa1079da3b41af5ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38e1ef3b7fe12587411fefa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的能量正在我的体内诞生～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad128467fb688c624b5eed16a509584bec3437d671989bb4083f0b840d5c3972",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6407e14e6db8376261cb7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！？看、看见了！\r\n是幸运气势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ec7cce76b6aa891add89f6dca0e37bc4a835fdb1a5141a09ba21c8734c115a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6071ca16af19bbbb9c90659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会带着你……\r\n一起获得最棒的幸运体验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc739ab12c05cb8e7a0f6493a1f7471cc23d879199ebb18d131505b085144b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e6f230294170d18696211a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼福来，\r\n我会带着满满的幸运前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edcbf2c0f098430f4f0e077bd0f43b0d002704ec4b88bba6ec96de3c516fd767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9481de3c711c027f43a7ddad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随心所欲地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec011f6695a00dd2c1a5582f44f935ea5711c986d3f322b5142de7783661d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b23acbf1fb1b1e3a2d18b0b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当你的梦想与我奔驰的身影\r\n交迭在一起时，\r\n心情一定会很舒畅吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad1ecb204f4870f9de16454ae9af60ea1dda46e057494aa148e81c83e2e6045",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019bca7bc05fe1531608db63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8866752d5a0a75099abb60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3488e94bb5d64f9e5fec7da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你理解自由的价值。\r\n倘若你我都能够做自己，那么待在\r\n彼此身边也是件很快乐的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd660a83b3189d12e17934467431c95bdc4ae05c9aaab9f74d3c87a47154c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7871e4466c3bd0f8fada1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知不觉间，\r\n在相同的地方留下了足迹……\r\n我很喜欢这样的经验呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbd51984ad158f02854dc1d9f5023781e34a24109a2ba12569659d969f471d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e7708ed3e0315e79522193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一年要开始了呢。\r\n那么就先将一切抛诸脑后，\r\n迈开脚步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "101a4f375870d06471c6452d96d9b862617698e17ec004361a54d7c98230c91a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12944cbf0e12a7b6332f47fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉今天的晚餐会是一堆巧克力。\r\n呵呵，很奢侈对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2efd68d9d031824efb25c264ffff1ccd50bb5b6ae235e20ceae85acb34481730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8245979ffc317345322b2d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真高兴可以见到你。\r\n我一直很想在与你四目交接的\r\n距离下，听听你的笑声呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45a64b7e5c04bd530b01ee71d4161e745749413c866aed55e08642328014ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be6bedb38c2d5e11cb07809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星们聚集起来，\r\n化作连系两人的桥梁……\r\n它们真是善良呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5339c4d64f539578291de0b2bcb14cebc3abe6d43f245aa8c3b6c207179f77bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c410c6cf1c9c8db9adb2c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刻意选择恶作剧也很不错对吧。\r\n毕竟这样会让我很期待\r\n对方打算对我做什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db80695765cb1c2a16055086d8dc7f95a4191d0e2f9794185fc6554fb1d0b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c743438309b3203ce9bcb0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声音与光线熠熠生辉，\r\n空气也在喧嚣着。\r\n能充分感受到欢闹的气氛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "476d57df6294dca9c80981af1352356b5dacd69d79e46582f7d41557ccc7833d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12624e8e96907520a710b7c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待会你打算怎么度过呢？\r\n我应该会在听了你的行程后，\r\n再决定要去哪里吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d7f8b1ac702f39d1f3d044bc05c3522e7c5a8c1d47a2014855515846746b4c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aad0133c070af81ef0ab01f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5d00a034cd0fa92bc961e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也要划下句号了呢……\r\n趁着现在回忆过去种种，\r\n也挺不错的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71187c9b6ee65ddcfa52d546e85dbc451a6b41b24a3b86e951caed8844f659e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6716c9e6ba1ab066638b685e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n我很想听你亲口告诉我，\r\n你这一年有什么改变呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713fe61e7d93f7f11e2c1533e02656d0d245c7d579c47748ac6a1a4d7f7486f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6290b966bdb79ae322ea0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看得出来你的瞳孔里写满雀跃。\r\n呵呵，希望从今以后的时间，\r\n也能够成为你的宝物呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb8a54fd775dc821eab05f25118d13a98f231b6f3e432021e41bd92fe9d0e9eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3222424917419a90076d5525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，对哦。\r\n原来今天是我的生日啊。不要紧，\r\n你可以保持平常心和我相处就好啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c50cbebedc71793241199194de253c133daf30ddd53506d7ab739f24dc0909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600a3b6f8595fc27114cd319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西？嗯……\r\n可以等我想到的时候再跟你说吗？\r\n因为我想好好珍惜收到的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64c682ad6486c89fbd038682123594949450a98bbf1ef43c6567e3e872f2c5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21f0b356794e3d54a78692d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了。\r\n有空的时候再去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb11d19aa4c9e6284afd0b4f834f9009b615d5c001785a358646003c6f76c72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b4caa45378e5c21514b825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物啰。\r\n希望是会让人开心的东西呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4080008fb06c99da9d4221703829ca4f34bf1ed4abf1bf6e319a44060728f45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3feec971d79d32c9443a7ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是你完成任务了。\r\n你这么认真，真是了不起呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05ad0498259f0fc63061c6a90d09e03b449914ea422f9e0b2348f4abde246a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18a18b5ded1bdf8fea12b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像很快就要办活动了。\r\n不知道届时会发生什么事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a5691adac6c945cdff5834f83235ec349b3a83a270e39a36fcdef13e6af03db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b8f571dce5203333e3a0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎开始了。\r\n待会过去露个脸吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "216670c09193b78441ce5dad970eaffade2800e2a20c9a162d5a20f472c444e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f55ffccdff52d0ea3789191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……再接再厉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e393779649c103908e67644db51f25f1522edd78bcdb438f48c42cce7791cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2640310b289029ca885abaa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说名册等级提升了。\r\n不知道变成什么样子了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b92425ec6804c2053aeff73f50c6345dc25b3ac83431104992cdab2ce24c3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c4a302d7587aab4ee2a079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャケット、好きなんだ。\r\nすぐ着られるし、すぐ脱げるから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9721a454ef7192ba8f769a5c4570eb7ee607fabe471ab51a2e4bbd5da331e98f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342430653ceee762b72f0366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ルドルフと外を歩いてると、\r\nみんなアタシにばかり話しかけて\r\nくるんだ。なんでかな？変なの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb72ae7e8ffab743b40abf29094ef17407349901b8f934958a464ba99ee745d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26adee743c83cc0ba1419d34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "デニムっていいよね。\r\n使えば使うほど、\r\nアタシの姿に馴染んでくれる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65add6b05e5faa5b3064a2a732dcb4f91964b662dc63ab26950ce1bed5c88c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "10027"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
